

# OilOps AI - Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in real values.
# Never commit a real .env file to version control.

# --- Application ---
# Path to the SQLite database file. Relative to project root is fine.
OILOPS_DB_PATH=database/oilops.db

# --- LLM (Optional) ---
# The system works fully without an API key. If a key is missing,
# the AI Expense Classifier falls back to a deterministic mock
# classifier so the workflow can still be exercised end-to-end.
#
# Examples (do NOT put real keys here):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-replace-me
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-replace-me